start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 2ch {[dc 2ch]x7}@ring ss@top # ch 5 = 1 dc + ch 2
R2: sl@sp {3ch=dc 2ch dc}@same ch [vst@sp ch]x7 ss@top # ch 5 = 1 dc + ch 2
R3: sl@sp {3ch=dc dc 2ch 2dc}@same 2ch [sh@sp 2ch]x7 ss@top
R4: sl@st sl@sp {3ch=dc 2dc 3ch 3dc}@same 3ch sc@sp 3ch [{3dc 3ch 3dc}@sp 3ch sc@sp 3ch]x3 ss@top
R5: 3ch=dc dc@same 2dc {2dc ch 2dc}@corner 2dc 2dc@st 3dc@sp dc@st 3dc@sp [2dc@st 2dc {2dc ch 2dc}@corner 2dc 2dc@st 3dc@sp dc@st 3dc@sp]x3 ss@top
